  "note": "Directus ids are UUIDs (users, roles, policies, folders, files, dashboards, panels, flows, comments) or auto-increment integers (items, presets); rea's built-in uuid and numeric rules template all of them (9 uuid + 4 numeric parameters, 14 groups), so the three opt-in rules change nothing: 43 tools with and without them. Collection names (crew_rota, provisions) are plain words and stay literal, so each collection has its own items, collections and fields tools."
 },
